---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy - Juan Obrach"
  description="How juanobrach.dev uses analytics and handles assistant conversations."
  pageType="unknown"
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <article class="privacy-content">
      <a href="/" class="privacy-back">← Back home</a>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>
        This site uses privacy-conscious analytics to understand whether the
        portfolio is helping visitors evaluate Juan's product engineering work.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          When configured, the site may use Google Analytics, PostHog, and
          Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure page visits, content engagement,
          CV downloads, outbound contact clicks, and assistant usage.
        </p>
        <p>
          PostHog tracking is explicit: broad autocapture, session recording,
          and input capture are disabled for this portfolio.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Assistant</h2>
        <p>
          The assistant sends your current question and recent in-browser chat
          context to a Supabase Edge Function so it can answer from public
          portfolio information.
        </p>
        <p>
          The site does not persist raw assistant transcripts by default.
          Analytics events use safe metadata such as topic category, route,
          status, and message length bucket instead of message text.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact Juan through email, LinkedIn, GitHub, or X/Twitter,
          those platforms handle the message according to their own policies.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
    <Footer />
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-back {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .privacy-back:hover {
    color: var(--accent-teal);
  }

  h1 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.25rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .privacy-content {
      padding: 3rem 1.25rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
